1413
01:00:23.370 --> 01:00:27.470
And a bear that was actively hunting them.
一直在猎杀他们。

1414
01:00:27.770 --> 01:00:28.090
Tracking them.
追踪他们。

1415
01:00:28.550 --> 01:00:28.930
Okay.
好吧。

1416
01:00:29.050 --> 01:00:34.810
I like the part when Anthony Hopkins, his character Charles, as you know, because Alec Baldwin,
我喜欢安东尼·霍普金斯演的查尔斯那个部分，你知道的，因为演罗伯特的亚历克·鲍德温，

