But she gets her key.
但她拿到了钥匙。

1588
01:06:42.040 --> 01:06:43.080
She's checking in.
她正在办理入住。

1589
01:06:43.080 --> 01:06:50.360
Oh, oh, Jenna, we have to talk about, this is the one moment in the whole episode that
噢，噢，珍娜，我们得谈谈，这是整集中唯一一个

1590
01:06:50.360 --> 01:06:52.760
Jim and Pam hear each other.
吉姆和帕姆能听到对方声音的时刻。

1591
01:06:53.220 --> 01:06:56.620
Jim and Pam, it's as close as they'll get to being together.
吉姆和帕姆，这是他们能达到的最亲近的时刻了。

1592
01:06:57.000 --> 01:07:01.860
And it's when Pam calls Michael and Jim overhears.
那是帕姆给迈克尔打电话，吉姆无意中听到了。

1593
01:07:01.860 --> 01:07:05.620
And he's like, hey, I'm with Jim and Dwight and Josh say hi.
他说，嘿，我和吉姆在一起，德怀特和乔什跟你问好。

1594
01:07:05.620 --> 01:07:06.760
And Pam's like, hi.
帕姆说，你好。

1595
01:07:07.160 --> 01:07:09.280
And that's it.
就这样。

1596
01:07:09.420 --> 01:07:10.620
That's their only moment.
那是他们唯一的互动瞬间。

1597
01:07:10.840 --> 01:07:13.580
But not only that, this is a layered moment.
不仅如此，这还是一个多层次的瞬间。

1598
01:07:13.580 --> 01:07:18.040
Because in this moment, not only did they hear each other's voices, but in this moment,
因为在这一刻，他们不仅听到了彼此的声音，而且在这一刻，

1599
01:07:18.360 --> 01:07:21.080
Jim knows that now that Pam is single.
吉姆知道帕姆现在单身了。

1600
01:07:21.280 --> 01:07:26.160
And Pam now knows that Jim knows because Michael wishes her good luck on your first date.
而帕姆现在也知道吉姆已经知道了，因为迈克尔祝她第一次约会好运。

1601
01:07:26.540 --> 01:07:26.740
Yeah.
是啊。

1602
01:07:27.100 --> 01:07:28.780
So Pam knows.
所以帕姆知道了。

1603
01:07:29.040 --> 01:07:30.240
Jim knows I'm single.
吉姆知道我是单身。

1604
01:07:30.400 --> 01:07:32.520
You know she was hoping he would find out somehow.
你知道她当时就希望他能以某种方式发现。

1605
01:07:32.960 --> 01:07:33.180
Yeah.
是啊。

1606
01:07:34.800 --> 01:07:35.780
Now he knows.
现在他知道了。

1607
01:07:36.000 --> 01:07:37.340
He doesn't call, though, does he?
但他没打电话，对吧？

1608
01:07:37.440 --> 01:07:38.320
He does not call.
他没打。

1609
01:07:38.540 --> 01:07:38.920
He doesn't call.
他没打电话。

1610
01:07:38.920 --> 01:07:39.860
She doesn't call him either.
她也没给他打。

1611
01:07:40.560 --> 01:07:42.080
Why aren't they calling each other?
为什么他们不给对方打电话呢？

1612
01:07:42.320 --> 01:07:43.000
I don't know.
我不知道。

1613
01:07:43.100 --> 01:07:44.060
Call each other.
给对方打个电话啊。

1614
01:07:44.480 --> 01:07:46.200
It's like the age of innocence.
这就像《纯真年代》一样。

1615
01:07:46.560 --> 01:07:47.360
I guess so.
我想也是。

1616
01:07:47.460 --> 01:07:48.420
That book made me crazy.
那本书让我抓狂。

1617
01:07:48.560 --> 01:07:50.600
I'm like, just be together already.
我就想说，你们赶紧在一起吧。

1618
01:07:50.820 --> 01:07:51.060
All right.
好吧。

1619
01:07:51.640 --> 01:07:55.960
Well, then Michael has a talking head where he's kind of going off on Jim.
那么，迈克尔有个访谈片段，他在里面对吉姆发了一通牢骚。

1620
01:07:56.160 --> 01:07:59.020
He says, Jim and I, we have different definitions of friendship.
他说，我和吉姆对友谊的定义不同。

1621
01:08:00.760 --> 01:08:05.780
Apparently, Jim thinks friendship is moving to Stanford, so he's not going to talk to Jim
显然，吉姆认为友谊就是搬到斯坦福，所以他打算不再和吉姆说话了。

1622
01:08:05.780 --> 01:08:06.180
anymore.
他受够了。

1623
01:08:07.120 --> 01:08:08.040
He's had enough.
他受够了。

1624
01:08:08.240 --> 01:08:09.000
He's like a jilted lover.
他就像个被抛弃的情人。

1625
01:08:09.260 --> 01:08:09.740
He is.
确实是。

1626
01:08:09.940 --> 01:08:10.520
He's so heartbroken.
他太伤心了。

1627
01:08:10.800 --> 01:08:11.520
He is.
确实是。

1628
01:08:11.700 --> 01:08:13.900
Angela, we had a really great fan catch.
安吉拉，我们抓到了一个很棒的粉丝发现。

1629
01:08:14.020 --> 01:08:14.680
You'll like it.
你会喜欢的。

1630
01:08:14.800 --> 01:08:16.040
It's from Claudia Cano.
来自克劳迪娅·卡诺。

1631
01:08:16.040 --> 01:08:20.800
She said, there is a rubber ducky in two shots.
她说，有两个镜头里出现了橡皮鸭。

1632
01:08:21.700 --> 01:08:25.960
There's one at 14 minutes, 56 seconds, which is in the background of this talking head.
一个在14分56秒，就在这个访谈片段的背景里。

1633
01:08:26.120 --> 01:08:28.380
And then again, at 19 minutes, 47 seconds.
另一个在19分47秒。

1634
01:08:28.560 --> 01:08:31.720
Did Michael travel with the rubber ducky or get it at the convention?
迈克尔是带着橡皮鸭旅行的，还是在大会上拿到的？

1635
01:08:32.020 --> 01:08:34.260
Oh, that was a convention giveaway for sure.
哦，那肯定是大会赠品。

1636
01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:35.500
That's swag, baby.
那是周边礼品，宝贝。

1637
01:08:35.860 --> 01:08:36.920
That's the swag.
就是那个周边。

1638
01:08:37.520 --> 01:08:38.100
There it is.
在那儿呢。

1639
01:08:38.840 --> 01:08:41.340
Underneath, like on the duck's belly, you can't see it.
在下面，就在鸭子肚子上，你看不到。

1640
01:08:41.460 --> 01:08:43.200
It probably says a paper company name.
上面可能印着某家造纸公司的名字。

1641
01:08:43.640 --> 01:08:44.360
For sure.
肯定的。

1642
01:08:44.360 --> 01:08:46.500
We're not quacking around.
我们可不是在“鸭”力山大（开玩笑）。

1643
01:08:46.500 --> 01:08:49.560
We're number one in colored paper.
我们在彩色纸张领域是第一名。

1644
01:08:51.370 --> 01:08:51.830
Exactly.
没错。

1645
01:08:52.190 --> 01:08:53.890
The duck stops here.
鸭子到此为止。

1646
01:08:54.870 --> 01:08:57.490
Angela, you are really good at these.
安吉拉，你真的很擅长这些。

1647
01:08:58.390 --> 01:08:59.490
Give me more.
再给我来点。

1648
01:08:59.770 --> 01:09:01.210
If you think of more, shout them out.
如果你还想到其他的，就大声说出来。

1649
01:09:01.450 --> 01:09:02.230
No, I won't.
不，我才不要。

1650
01:09:02.450 --> 01:09:02.910
Okay.
好吧。

1651
01:09:03.170 --> 01:09:09.670
Well, my favorite part of this talking head, Angela, is that we widen to reveal that Michael
安吉拉，我最喜欢这段访谈的部分是，镜头拉远后发现迈克尔

1652
01:09:09.670 --> 01:09:12.690
is actually having a drink with the hammer mill rep.
其实正和锤磨机公司的代表一起喝酒。

1653
01:09:12.990 --> 01:09:13.650
I know.
我知道。

1654
01:09:13.650 --> 01:09:17.490
This whole talking head has been delivered with another person in the room.
整段访谈录制时，房间里还有另一个人。

1655
01:09:17.970 --> 01:09:21.010
I have a fun fact about the hammer mill rep.
关于这位锤磨机代表，我有个趣事。

1656
01:09:21.290 --> 01:09:21.670
Okay.
好啊。

1657
01:09:22.130 --> 01:09:24.690
That was played by actor Matt Price.
他是由演员马特·普莱斯饰演的。

1658
01:09:25.070 --> 01:09:29.790
Angela, Matt Price screen tested for the role of Dwight.
安吉拉，马特·普莱斯曾参加过德怀特这个角色的试镜。

1659
01:09:30.350 --> 01:09:30.910
What?
什么？

1660
01:09:31.310 --> 01:09:31.830
No.
真的吗？

1661
01:09:32.390 --> 01:09:34.130
I screen tested with him.
我和他一起试镜过。

1662
01:09:34.330 --> 01:09:38.170
He was one of the people that I was paired with at the final audition.
在最终试镜时，他是我搭档的演员之一。

1663
01:09:38.170 --> 01:09:39.210
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1664
01:09:39.710 --> 01:09:40.690
They loved him.
他们当时很喜欢他。

1665
01:09:40.790 --> 01:09:43.730
And Greg wanted a way to bring him back.
格雷格想找个机会让他回来。

1666
01:09:43.930 --> 01:09:49.410
And by the way, as we go through the series, a lot of the people who had final screen tests
顺便说一下，随着剧集的推进，很多参加过主要角色最终试镜的演员

1667
01:09:49.410 --> 01:09:55.050
for main roles are brought back as guest stars throughout the show because Greg just loved
后来都以客串明星的身份回到了剧中，因为格雷格实在太喜欢他们了。

1668
01:09:55.050 --> 01:09:55.870
them so much.
这一点我真的很欣赏格雷格。

1669
01:09:56.310 --> 01:09:57.790
I love that about Greg.
我也是。

1670
01:09:57.790 --> 01:09:58.490
I know.
我知道。

1671
01:09:58.630 --> 01:09:59.830
He doesn't forget people.
他不会忘记别人。

1672
01:09:59.990 --> 01:10:00.690
He does not.
确实不会。

1673
01:10:00.690 --> 01:10:03.290
If you impress him, he'll find a place for you.
如果你能给他留下深刻印象，他一定会为你安排一个位置。

1674
01:10:03.470 --> 01:10:03.690
All right.
好吧。

1675
01:10:03.770 --> 01:10:07.770
So at 15 minutes, 42 seconds, Jim is now going to prank Dwight.
那么在15分42秒，吉姆准备要捉弄德怀特了。

1676
01:10:07.950 --> 01:10:09.190
It's like old times, right?
就像以前一样，对吧？

1677
01:10:09.210 --> 01:10:13.490
He got a key to his room and he is going to go in there and do something.
他拿到了德怀特房间的钥匙，准备进去搞点事情。

1678
01:10:14.890 --> 01:10:15.410
All right.
好的。

1679
01:10:15.450 --> 01:10:17.330
I have some stories about this day.
关于这一天，我有些故事要讲。

1680
01:10:17.570 --> 01:10:17.970
Yes.
好啊。

1681
01:10:17.970 --> 01:10:21.010
Because what happens when he opens the door, Angela?
因为当他打开门时发生了什么，安吉拉？

1682
01:10:21.190 --> 01:10:22.170
What does Jim find?
吉姆发现了什么？

1683
01:10:22.610 --> 01:10:24.650
A lady on the bed.
床上有一个女人。

1684
01:10:24.830 --> 01:10:29.610
He finds someone who he thinks is a hooker, but it's actually Angela.
他以为那是妓女，但其实是安吉拉。

1685
01:10:29.910 --> 01:10:30.170
All right.
好吧。

1686
01:10:30.470 --> 01:10:33.030
Well, Angela, fan question from Iva Earl.
安吉拉，有个来自艾娃·厄尔的粉丝提问。

1687
01:10:33.550 --> 01:10:37.150
Angela, is that really your leg that we see in Dwight's hotel room?
安吉拉，我们在德怀特的酒店房间里看到的腿真的是你的吗？

1688
01:10:37.750 --> 01:10:39.770
Yes, it's really my leg.
是的，那确实是我的腿。

1689
01:10:39.870 --> 01:10:42.790
And of course, they had a whole outfit picked out for me.
当然，他们为我挑选了一整套行头。

1690
01:10:42.930 --> 01:10:46.850
I had to have a wardrobe fitting for it, even though you don't really see much.
我为此专门试了装，尽管镜头里其实没拍到多少。

1691
01:10:46.850 --> 01:10:53.070
It was conservative, sorry to disappoint, but it was a pink pajama top, long sleeve.
那是一件保守的粉色长袖睡衣上衣，抱歉让大家失望了。

1692
01:10:53.370 --> 01:10:58.970
And then I have these black polka dot pants, like pajama pants, but they were kind of satiny.
然后我穿了一条黑色波点裤子，像是睡裤，但质地有点像绸缎。

1693
01:10:59.690 --> 01:11:02.110
Oh, that's the sexy part.
哦，那才是性感的部分。

1694
01:11:02.390 --> 01:11:02.770
Yes.
没错。

1695
01:11:02.910 --> 01:11:10.730
And so you could see my calf when I raised my leg and I had painted my toenails red.
所以当我抬腿时能看到我的小腿，而且我把脚趾甲涂成了红色。

1696
01:11:11.370 --> 01:11:12.810
So there's that.
事情就是这样。

1697
01:11:12.810 --> 01:11:20.350
But I had talked about this scene in an interview because I don't ever get any scenes with Jim.
但我曾在一次采访中提到过这场戏，因为我几乎没机会和吉姆演对手戏。

1698
01:11:20.610 --> 01:11:24.310
Jim and Angela rarely interact if you watch the whole show.
如果你看完整部剧，会发现吉姆和安吉拉几乎没什么互动。

1699
01:11:24.750 --> 01:11:24.870
Yeah.
确实。

1700
01:11:25.170 --> 01:11:28.410
So John and I, as friends in real life, we were giddy.
所以约翰和我，作为现实生活中的朋友，当时都兴奋极了。

1701
01:11:28.590 --> 01:11:31.310
We were so excited to finally be in the scene together.
我们当时特别兴奋，终于能一起演对手戏了。

1702
01:11:31.310 --> 01:11:41.430
And what you guys didn't see was when he opens the door, there's a mirror on the wall and he sees my legs and he freaks out.
你们没看到的是，当他打开门时，墙上有一面镜子，他看到了我的腿，然后就吓坏了。

1703
01:11:41.430 --> 01:11:44.810
But I could see his whole expression in the mirror.
但我能从镜子里看到他所有的表情。

1704
01:11:44.970 --> 01:11:46.330
I could see everything.
我什么都能看到。

1705
01:11:46.790 --> 01:11:57.330
And his face, when he saw my legs, every time John did the scene, he would do this range of reaction of like horror and just like shock.
当他看到我的腿时，约翰每次演这场戏，都会做出那种惊恐和震惊的反应。

1706
01:11:57.330 --> 01:11:59.210
And it was so funny.
真的太搞笑了。

1707
01:11:59.370 --> 01:12:02.630
We were laughing so hard, trying not to ruin the takes.
我们当时笑得不行，努力不让拍摄穿帮。

1708
01:12:02.850 --> 01:12:04.690
And then, of course, my character's like, D?
然后，当然了，我的角色说：D？

1709
01:12:05.230 --> 01:12:08.390
And they were debating on how much of me they were going to see.
他们当时还在讨论到底要拍到我多少部分。

1710
01:12:08.650 --> 01:12:09.010
Yeah.
是啊。

1711
01:12:09.130 --> 01:12:09.710
Just my legs.
就拍我的腿。

1712
01:12:09.870 --> 01:12:10.830
To really sell it.
为了更有说服力。

1713
01:12:10.930 --> 01:12:14.970
Like, how much did Jim see of me, right?
就是说，吉姆到底看到了我多少，对吧？

1714
01:12:15.210 --> 01:12:15.470
Yeah.
没错。

1715
01:12:15.490 --> 01:12:17.190
So we sort of played around with that a little bit.
所以我们稍微尝试了一下。

1716
01:12:17.350 --> 01:12:20.970
And then, Jenna, I think this is the first time my character calls Dwight D.
还有，珍娜，我觉得这是我的角色第一次叫德怀特为D。

1717
01:12:20.970 --> 01:12:22.710
And we established that nickname.
我们确立了这个昵称。

1718
01:12:23.070 --> 01:12:24.290
I think it is.
我想是的。

1719
01:12:24.450 --> 01:12:24.810
Yeah.
是啊。

1720
01:12:25.310 --> 01:12:25.770
Yes.
没错。

1721
01:12:25.770 --> 01:12:26.210
I don't know.
我不知道。

1722
01:12:26.350 --> 01:12:27.350
We'll track it, guys.
我们会去查证的，伙计们。

1723
01:12:27.530 --> 01:12:27.990
We'll track it.
我们会查清楚的。

1724
01:12:28.090 --> 01:12:29.950
But I think this is the first time I call him D.
但我认为这是我第一次叫他D。

1725
01:12:30.110 --> 01:12:37.350
Angela, I think we need to go on a double date now with Ryan, Kelly, Pam, and Alan.
安吉拉，我觉得我们现在得和瑞安、凯莉、帕姆还有艾伦来场双重约会了。

1726
01:12:38.310 --> 01:12:39.430
So cringy.
太尴尬了。

1727
01:12:39.830 --> 01:12:43.050
Jenna, this scene was so awkward to watch.
珍娜，这场戏看得人太尴尬了。

1728
01:12:43.710 --> 01:12:44.270
Yes.
确实。

1729
01:12:44.470 --> 01:12:47.850
Kelly is force feeding Ryan some French fries with ketchup.
凯莉正强行喂瑞安吃蘸了番茄酱的薯条。

1730
01:12:48.330 --> 01:12:50.530
She insists that he loves it.
她坚持说他很喜欢。

1731
01:12:50.530 --> 01:12:51.630
He loves ketchup.
他喜欢番茄酱。

1732
01:12:52.210 --> 01:12:53.250
He loves it.
他很喜欢。

1733
01:12:53.370 --> 01:12:57.210
And then Alan, I mean, Alan is just kind of cheesy, Jenna.
还有艾伦，我是说，艾伦那种感觉太俗气了，珍娜。

1734
01:12:57.490 --> 01:12:58.230
He's just a little.
他就是有点。

1735
01:12:58.230 --> 01:12:58.750
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1736
01:13:00.010 --> 01:13:00.530
Yes.
没错。

1737
01:13:00.730 --> 01:13:07.410
Well, Robert told me that his favorite Alan line is people always say, don't be edgy,
罗伯特告诉我，他最喜欢的艾伦台词是：人们总说，别太前卫，

1738
01:13:07.550 --> 01:13:09.450
but I don't know any other way.
但我不知道还有什么别的方式。

1739
01:13:09.810 --> 01:13:12.570
He was like, it was so pretentious.
他说这太自命不凡了。

1740
01:13:12.910 --> 01:13:15.010
It said it was such great comic writing.
他说这是非常棒的喜剧写作。

1741
01:13:15.270 --> 01:13:19.950
He also told me that he still gets recognized as the Freedom Fries guy.
他还告诉我，他现在还会因为“自由薯条男”这个角色被认出来。

1742
01:13:21.210 --> 01:13:22.550
And he's very grateful.
而且他非常感激。

1743
01:13:22.950 --> 01:13:23.150
Is that what people call him?
人们真的这么叫他吗？

1744
01:13:23.290 --> 01:13:25.070
Do people call him the Freedom Fries guy?
人们真的叫他“自由薯条男”吗？

1745
01:13:25.370 --> 01:13:26.110
Freedom Fries guy.
自由薯条男。

